  "assembly": [
    "Extract only bash.exe, msys-2.0.dll, grep.exe, msys-pcre-1.dll, msys-intl-8.dll and msys-iconv-2.dll from PortableGit/usr/bin.",
    "Bash, GNU grep and MSYS DLLs retain their upstream bytes. BusyBox is locally rebuilt from the bundled modified source using the pinned MSVCRT toolchain.",
    "Compress each binary separately using gzip level 9 with mtime=0. Include both locally built BusyBox Unicode binaries under their architecture-specific asset names.",
    "The immutable runtime id is bash-busybox- followed by the first 12 hex characters of SHA-256 over Python json.dumps(files, sort_keys=True).",
    "At runtime create BusyBox applet hard links; sh.exe links to GNU bash.exe. GNU grep is a separate program.",
    "Keep matching license notices and corresponding source directions. BusyBox complete source is included in this package."
